<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 mb-6">
<h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Sample: Employment Contract, Apex Consulting Ltd</h3>
<div class="space-y-3">
<div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4">
<h4 class="font-semibold text-red-800 flex items-center gap-2"><AlertTriangle class="w-4 h-4" /> CRITICAL — Unilateral Salary Deduction</h4>
<p class="text-red-700 text-sm mt-1">Clause 6.3 lets the employer deduct "any amounts considered outstanding" with no notice and no right to dispute.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-lg p-4">
<h4 class="font-semibold text-yellow-800 flex items-center gap-2"><AlertTriangle class="w-4 h-4" /> MEDIUM — 12-Month Probation</h4>
<p class="text-yellow-700 text-sm mt-1">Termination on one week's notice during a 12-month probation is unusually long and one-sided.</p>
</div>
